# COMPOSED DRAFT: unrun, not accepted; missing-source fault injection is separate.
# Draft: real capture, authored citation and real Knot selection; not acceptance complete.
settle 20
key escape
act New session
settle 5
act Rename session
type M5 seed
key enter
settle 5
act New research note
wait-knot 600 local file:///m5/run/profile/notes/research-
assert content-live
click surface:knot role:textbox
key end
key enter
insert M5 authored research note
key ctrl+s
settle 30
assert text saved
capture 01_authored_note
act Show document in map
open ${M5_ORIGIN}/A
settle 20
act Open Inspector pane
settle 5
wait-source-target 600 ${M5_ORIGIN}/A
settle 3
scroll 900 500 -5000
settle 3
scroll 900 500 350
settle 3
click surface:inspector role:button Save source and keep
wait-row 600 Source save: Saved
record-source-captures 02_A1
act Show document in map
open ${M5_ORIGIN}/B
settle 20
act Open Inspector pane
settle 5
wait-source-target 600 ${M5_ORIGIN}/B
settle 3
scroll 900 500 -5000
settle 3
scroll 900 500 350
settle 3
click surface:inspector role:button Save source and keep
wait-row 600 Source save: Saved
record-source-captures 03_B
act Search saved sources
type naïve — 東京 🐦
wait-research-search 600
choose-suggestion Capture: M5 A
wait-saved-reader 600
assert snap saved-reader-quote == M5 A1 archive: naïve — 東京 🐦. Evidence amount is 12 units.
record-saved-sources 04_exact_A1
capture 04_exact_A1
act Open Inspector pane
settle 8
scroll 900 500 5000
settle 3
click surface:inspector role:button Research tools
settle 5
scroll 900 500 5000
settle 3
click surface:inspector role:button Clip saved passage
settle 60
act Open research note
settle 20
assert text M5 authored research note
assert text Read saved passage 1:
capture 05_note_citation
click .knot-saved-citation Read saved passage 1:
settle 5
assert snap focus-card-peek ~ mere://saved-source/sealed-v1/
click surface:chrome role:button Read
wait-saved-reader 600
assert snap saved-reader-quote == M5 A1 archive: naïve — 東京 🐦. Evidence amount is 12 units.
record-saved-sources 06_note_citation
act Open research note
act Read document
settle 20
capture 09_before_editor_click
click-at 200 220
key end
key enter
insert M5 private preface zebra only this linked finding M5 private suffix otter
settle 10
capture 10_after_editor_insert
assert text only this linked finding
assert event m5-intentional-diagnostic-stop
